{"surah":109,"ayahs":["قُلْ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">يَٰٓ</span>أَيُّهَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">كَٰ</span>فِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">رُو</span>نَ","<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">لَآ</span> أَعْبُدُ مَا تَعْبُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دُو</span>نَ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">لَآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نتُ</span>مْ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">عَٰ</span>بِدُونَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span> أَعْبُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دُ</span>","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">لَآ</span> أَنَا۟ عَابِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">دٌ مَّ</span>ا عَبَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_mutajanisayn\">د</span>تُّمْ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">لَآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نتُ</span>مْ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">عَٰ</span>بِدُونَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span> أَعْبُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دُ</span>","لَكُمْ دِينُكُمْ وَلِىَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دِي</span>نِ"]}